  cal-20261002-s5-052,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Would writing my own one-paragraph summary of a session, before reading the agent's notes, change what I act on?","Every Calibrator note is agent-written. Source: my notes, 2 October.",write the summary before reading the notes,read the agent's notes first,calibration,76,74,82,80,84,explore,Resolved by a later note comparing my summary with the agent's notes; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-053,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would a practising engineer pay for any of my structural tools?,"No engineer has used them; the next one is aimed at practising engineers. Source: my notes, 2 October.",ask that alongside the hand-calculation question,keep them free and unasked,synthesis,76,74,80,86,80,explore,Resolved by a later note recording an engineer's answer; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-054,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is posting one specific hand-calculation question about beamdiag in a public forum by 9 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-09 records the question posted; false otherwise.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-055,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is reading one textbook chapter in full by 31 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-31 records a textbook chapter read in full; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-056,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is keeping one evening a week free of the fleet by 31 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-31 records a fleet-free evening in each week from 5 October; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-057,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Is fixing two strength mornings a week, with the days named, by 5 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?","My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-11 records the two mornings named and kept in the week starting 5 October; false otherwise.,2026-10-11,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-058,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is pruning the Open questions page in a closing note by 9 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-09 records a closing note that drops or parks at least one open todo; false otherwise.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-059,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is writing the next blog post for a reader I name by 31 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-31 records a published post that names its intended reader; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-060,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is finding one university lecturer to try beamdiag by 31 October one of the eight todos I would bet on finishing?,"My todo list can hold eight; this was endorsed in session 4. Source: my notes, 2 October.",make it a dated todo with a done-condition,leave it as a note,notes,78,88,70,70,90,exploit,Resolved true if a note by 2026-10-31 records a lecturer contacted about beamdiag; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-061,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Will the next beamdiag feature come from a reply to the posted hand-calculation question?,"New beamdiag features came off the stop list; the question is not posted yet. Source: my notes, 2 October.",hold beamdiag features until a reply arrives,add features as I see fit,notes,76,76,80,78,82,exploit,"Resolved by the next beamdiag feat commit or note by 2026-11-30: true if it cites a reply.",2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-062,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Will a crewmate commit a new private path to a public repository by 31 October?,"The scan found earlier ones; push protection covers known token formats only. Source: my notes, 2 October.",add a private-path rule to the brief template,rely on the next scan,synthesis,76,74,80,82,80,exploit,Resolved true if a scan or note by 2026-10-31 finds a private path committed after 2026-10-02; false if a scan finds none.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-063,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would a hiring manager reading this week's notes see more agent management than mathematics or engineering?,"I chose public repositories over certificates as my signal. Source: my notes.",write a first-hand mathematics or engineering note before the next agent note,keep the notes as they are,synthesis,74,66,86,90,78,explore,"Resolved by a tally of this week's notes by tag in a later note: true if #agents notes outnumber mathematics and structural-engineering notes together.",2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-064,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Should hand-calculation exports be checked by an engineer before more tools get them?,"Beamdiag, sectionlab, Mohr and fastener-cg export hand calculations; none has been checked by an engineer. Source: visualisations catalogue.",pause new hand-calculation exports until one is checked,keep adding them,synthesis,74,76,78,82,80,exploit,Resolved true if no new hand-calculation export lands before a note records an engineer's check; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-065,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Are my answers on personal review versus automated checks shaped by how the cards phrase the actions?,"Three sessions point the same way on review. Source: my notes, 2 October.",re-ask two such cards with the actions reworded,take the answers at face value,calibration,76,70,84,80,80,explore,"Resolved by a later session comparing reworded re-asks: true if two or more move by 20 points or more.",2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-066,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Do my Calibrator cards use loaded terms that tilt my answers, as my notes on presupposing terms warn?","My notes ask me to find terms that silently presuppose a disputed viewpoint. Source: my notes, 24 September.",have the generator flag loaded terms in each card,leave the wording as it is,synthesis,76,70,86,82,76,explore,Resolved by a later note auditing one session's wording; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-067,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Are cards about Calibrator itself crowding out cards about my work?,"This session carries more than ten cards on Calibrator and how I answer it. Source: Calibrator sessions.",cap Calibrator cards at five a session,leave them uncapped,calibration,74,72,80,82,80,exploit,Resolved by a later note judging session 5's Calibrator cards; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-068,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would cards drawn from open pull requests catch work in flight better than holding work behind cards?,"Holding work named on an open card was endorsed. Source: my notes, 2 October.",add a card for each open pull request on a card's matter,rely on holding work,calibration,76,72,80,76,82,exploit,Resolved by a later note on work that landed around a card by 2026-10-31; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-069,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Should my weekly status line live in data/notes.md under a status tag rather than on a page of its own?,"A weekly one-line status note and a crewmate for the feed were both endorsed. Source: my notes, 2 October.",write it in my notes under a status tag,brief a crewmate for a status page,notes,74,78,76,74,84,exploit,"Resolved by where the first weekly status line appears by 2026-10-16: true if in data/notes.md.",2026-10-16,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-070,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Have I shown Calibrator to anyone?,"It is the most useful thing I built this month; no outside reader is known. Source: my notes, 2 October.",ask that person what they would change,show it to one person this week,synthesis,74,72,80,78,82,explore,"Resolved by my answer, as a fact; a later note may record their reaction.",next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-071,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would the chapter I read in full this month be on étale cohomology rather than Shimura varieties?,"November is the étale month; a weekly Shimura block runs alongside. Source: my notes, 2 October.",read an étale-cohomology chapter,read a Shimura-variety chapter,notes,76,76,78,72,84,exploit,"Resolved by the note recording the chapter read: true if it is on étale cohomology.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-072,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Is 70 still the right threshold for endorsing a card's high action, now that 16 of 20 resolved answers at 70 or more came true?","The threshold of 70 was kept in session 3. Source: my notes, 2 October.",keep 70,raise it to 80,calibration,78,72,76,76,84,exploit,"Resolved when 40 answers of 70 or more have resolved: true if at least 70% of those between 70 and 79 came true.",2027-03-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-073,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Were my 100% answers in session 4 on my own plans wishes rather than forecasts?,"Ten answers in session 4 were 100%, five of them on plans. Source: raw.toon.",keep reading 100s on plans as wishes,read them as forecasts from now on,calibration,78,72,78,74,84,exploit,"Resolved when the five plan cards (s4-032, -036, -093, -096, -099) resolve: true if two or more come out false.",2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-074,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Does the QED laboratory's Connes–Kreimer lens count as this month's noncommutative-geometry work?,"The laboratory includes spectral triples and Connes–Kreimer renormalisation. Source: visualisations catalogue.",count the laboratory and drop the separate note,write the noncommutative-geometry note anyway,project,74,72,84,76,80,explore,Resolved true if no #noncommutative-geometry note is dated in October and a note credits the laboratory; false if such a note appears.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-075,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Should cards that resolve within a day be scored apart from the rest in the monthly Brier note?,"Seven cards resolved on 2 October from things already done; the Brier score over 28 is 0.175. Source: raw.toon.",score them separately,score all resolved cards together,calibration,78,70,80,74,84,exploit,Resolved true if the first monthly Brier note reports them separately; false otherwise.,2026-11-02,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-076,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would a crewmate's draft of the beamdiag hand-calculation question get better answers than one I write myself?,"Session 4 kept the Calibrator post as a crewmate's draft; the beamdiag question is not written yet. Source: my notes, 2 October.",ask a crewmate for a draft of the question,write the question myself,synthesis,74,78,76,74,82,exploit,"Resolved by a later note on the replies: true if a crewmate drafted the question and it got a substantive answer; unresolved otherwise.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-077,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Have I used the papers page, with its 16,431 links, to find a paper in the last month?","It lists 16,431 paper links. Source: papers page.",keep maintaining it,stop adding to it,project,76,72,82,78,76,explore,"Resolved by my answer, as a fact about the last month.",next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-078,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Is mental computation, my most used tag in September, fading because textbook problems are taking its place?","Session 4 turned the mathematics blocks towards textbook problems. Source: my notes, 2 October.",let the ladders fade,keep one ladder a week,notes,74,70,80,80,80,explore,"Resolved by counting notes tagged mental-computation dated 2026-10-01 to 2026-10-31: true if fewer than two.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-079,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Would 150 cards a session give me more than 100, now that I answer 100 in about nine minutes?","Sessions 2 to 4 took about 11, 11 and 9 minutes. Source: raw.toon.",raise sessions to 150 cards,keep 100,calibration,72,70,80,78,82,explore,Resolved by a later note comparing a 150-card session's notes with a 100-card one; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-080,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is reading one chapter in full harder for me now than a month ago?,"Reading a chapter in full was endorsed over ten ports. Source: my notes, 2 October.",read the first ten pages today as a test,trust that I can,synthesis,72,70,82,80,78,explore,"Resolved by a later note on the chapter: true if it records trouble finishing it.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-081,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Have I watched any of my own explainer videos in full?,"The site holds six media items made from my notes. Source: site media page.",keep making videos,make no new video until I have watched one,project,74,72,76,80,78,explore,"Resolved by my answer, as a fact; a later note may record a viewing.",next session,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-082,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Will three first-hand observations happen in their first week without a fixed time of day?,"Three observations a week start on 5 October. Source: my notes, 2 October.",leave the time flexible,fix a time for them now,notes,74,74,72,76,84,exploit,Resolved true if three first-hand notes are dated 2026-10-05 to 2026-10-11 and no fixed time is recorded; false if fewer.,2026-10-11,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-083,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Would a 22:00 curfew give me seven hours of sleep on more nights than 23:00?","The curfew moved from midnight to 23:00; nothing enforces it yet. Source: my notes, 2 October.","set the hook to 22:00","keep 23:00",notes,72,74,74,76,82,exploit,Resolved by a later note comparing sleep under both; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-084,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would reading one textbook chapter in full this month teach me more than ten visualisation ports?,"Ports continue at this week's pace. Source: my notes, 2 October.",read one chapter in full this month,keep porting at this pace,synthesis,70,66,80,84,76,explore,Resolved by a later note judging a fully read chapter against the month's ports; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-085,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is the agent-written psychoanalytic reading of Kun Chen's interview one I agree with?,"The note reads his panic at smooth projects as fear of no longer being needed. Source: my notes, 2 October.",keep the note as it is,add my own reading in a new note,notes,72,66,86,80,72,explore,Resolved by a later note on it; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-086,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Should the style guide also restyle the site's own pages, notes and blog?","It now covers visualisations only. Source: site PR 131.",apply it to the site's pages next,keep it to visualisations,project,74,72,78,72,78,explore,Resolved true if a commit by 2026-11-30 applies the style guide to templates/base.html; false otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-087,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would removing the private paths the scan found from current files be worth a crewmate task?,"The scan rated them low severity; agents' commits now use the GitHub no-reply email. Source: my notes, 2 October.",brief a crewmate to remove them from current files,leave them as they are,project,74,72,78,70,80,exploit,Resolved true if commits removing them land by 2026-10-31; false otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-088,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Will my public repositories pass 70 by 31 October?,"62 public repositories on 2 October; each new visualisation gets its own. Source: GitHub.",cap new repositories for the rest of October,leave repository creation uncapped,project,72,70,80,78,74,explore,"Resolved from the GitHub API on 2026-10-31: true if yujieteo has more than 70 public repositories.",2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-089,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would writing one line on each of my top five answers after a session give the recording crewmate better notes?,"The crewmate reads only the numbers and the cards. Source: Calibrator sessions.",write five lines after each session,leave the reading to the crewmate,calibration,74,70,78,72,80,exploit,Resolved by a later note comparing notes made with and without the lines; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-090,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would generating session 6 after the 9 and 10 October deadlines give better cards than generating it as soon as this one is recorded?,"The token audit, gym-bag outcome and wildcard fall due on 9 and 10 October. Source: my notes, 2 October.",generate session 6 after 10 October,generate it as soon as this one is recorded,calibration,70,70,74,76,80,exploit,Resolved by a later note comparing sessions generated before and after deadlines; unresolved otherwise.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-091,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would splitting the papers corpus out of the site build save more time than it costs?,"Every site build regenerates the 16,431-link papers page and its exports, and the site tests check them. Source: scripts/build.py.",split the papers out of the site build,keep them in,project,72,70,82,74,72,exploit,Resolved true if a commit by 2026-12-31 moves the papers out of scripts/build.py; false otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-092,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Would a narrated deck of one hand calculation be a better first message to engineers than a forum question?,"Beamdiag already makes narrated hand-calculation decks. Source: visualisations catalogue.",lead with the deck,lead with the question,synthesis,70,72,78,70,78,explore,Resolved by a later note comparing replies to either; unresolved otherwise.,2026-12-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-093,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Do I already know whether both gym-bag strength sessions happened?,"Its outcome is due 9 October and unrecorded. Source: my notes, 2 October.",record it today,wait until 9 October,notes,72,78,66,70,82,exploit,Resolved true if a note dated 2026-10-03 or earlier records the outcome; false if it is first recorded later.,2026-10-09,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-094,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Will the November listener be someone who already knows étale cohomology?,"The listener is to be one person I know, met in person. Source: my notes, 2 October.",look for a mathematician,look for a curious non-specialist,notes,70,70,78,70,78,explore,"Resolved by the note recording the November explanation: true if the listener knew étale cohomology.",2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-095,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Should FPL leave Calibrator as well as my notes?,"I chose to drop FPL notes and just play. Source: my notes, 2 October.",ask no FPL cards from now,keep one FPL card a session,calibration,70,72,74,72,76,exploit,Resolved by a later note on FPL in Calibrator; unresolved otherwise.,2026-11-30,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-096,cal-2026-10-02-s5,"Should the FPL mini-league todo be done on joining, without a note naming the league?","Its done-condition is a note naming the league, and FPL notes are dropped. Source: my notes, 2 October.",change its done-condition to joining,keep the note naming the league,notes,66,68,74,64,74,exploit,Resolved true if a closing note marks it done without naming the league; false if a note names it.,2026-10-10,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-097,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is my hypothesis on why voters back candidates whose policies lack majority support one I would still develop?,"An open todo, untouched since it was written. Source: my notes, 6 November 2025.",date it with a done-condition,drop it in a closing note,notes,68,72,66,70,62,explore,Resolved true if a dated #todo or note developing it appears by 2026-10-31; false if a closing note drops it.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-098,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is finding the speaker of the quotation “I would rather lose than sell out” worth a dated todo?,"An open todo, untouched since it was written. Source: my notes, 6 November 2025.",date it with a done-condition,drop it in a closing note,notes,68,72,66,70,62,explore,Resolved true if a dated #todo or note developing it appears by 2026-10-31; false if a closing note drops it.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-099,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is my hypothesis comparing central planning with markets as capital allocators one I would still develop?,"An open todo, untouched since it was written. Source: my notes, 6 November 2025.",date it with a done-condition,drop it in a closing note,notes,68,72,66,70,62,explore,Resolved true if a dated #todo or note developing it appears by 2026-10-31; false if a closing note drops it.,2026-10-31,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
  cal-20261002-s5-100,cal-2026-10-02-s5,Is the item I most want to keep on the Open questions page one I have not touched in a month?,"Todos live there alongside open questions. Source: Open questions page.",date it or drop it this week,leave it untouched,notes,58,58,72,70,66,exploit,Resolved by my answer in session 5; unresolved otherwise.,session 5,unresolved,null,null,"2026-10-02T09:55:00Z"
