  cal-20261002-s5-062,s1,"Push protection covers known token formats, not private paths."
  cal-20261002-s5-063,s1,Public repositories are the better signal than certificates.
  cal-20261002-s5-064,s1,Beamdiag exports step-by-step hand calculations.
  cal-20261002-s5-065,s1,Session 4 is the third confirmation that I trust automated checks over my own review.
  cal-20261002-s5-066,s1,"Identify terms that are ambiguous, misleading or silently presuppose a disputed viewpoint."
  cal-20261002-s5-067,s1,Each session is published in the calibrator repository.
  cal-20261002-s5-068,s1,A crewmate is expected to land work an unanswered card covers again.
  cal-20261002-s5-069,s1,The status is a weekly line I write myself; where it lives is open.
  cal-20261002-s5-070,s1,Calibrator is the most useful thing I built this month.
  cal-20261002-s5-071,s1,A weekly Shimura-variety block continues through the étale month.
  cal-20261002-s5-072,s1,70 stays the endorsement threshold.
  cal-20261002-s5-073,s1,Session 4 has ten answers at 100 and one at 0.
