  cal-20261002-s5-083,s1,"The curfew moves to 23:00."
  cal-20261002-s5-084,s1,Porting continues at this pace.
  cal-20261002-s5-085,s1,"The psychoanalytic reading is the note's interpretation, not Kun Chen's claim."
  cal-20261002-s5-086,s1,The style guide is being applied to visualisations.
