  cal-20261002-s5-089,s1,The crewmate appends the export and writes consequential notes.
  cal-20261002-s5-090,s1,Generate the next session as soon as one is recorded.
  cal-20261002-s5-091,s1,The site build generates the papers page and its exports.
  cal-20261002-s5-092,s1,Beamdiag produces a narrated hand-calculation deck.
  cal-20261002-s5-093,s1,The gym-bag experiment's outcome is not recorded.
  cal-20261002-s5-094,s1,The November listener is to be one person I know rather than an online group.
  cal-20261002-s5-095,s1,FPL notes are dropped; I just play.
